3
00:00:04.222 --> 00:00:06.092
They're called megaliths.

4
00:00:06.435 --> 00:00:08.961
Megaliths are stone burials: cists,

5
00:00:08.961 --> 00:00:11.005
dolmens and stone circles.

6
00:00:11.005 --> 00:00:12.558
Often with iron tools and

7
00:00:12.558 --> 00:00:14.265
black-and-red pottery.

8
00:00:14.602 --> 00:00:16.863
Brahmagiri in Karnataka,

9
00:00:16.863 --> 00:00:19.467
and Adichanallur in Tamil Nadu.

10
00:00:19.793 --> 00:00:21.813
The topic also covers pastoral

11
00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:24.279
and farming communities that grew

12
00:00:24.279 --> 00:00:25.974
far from the Indus.

13
00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:27.829
Your turn.

14
00:00:27.829 --> 00:00:30.163
What are they associated with?
